ic stylistic features of the work, analyses them in detail, and seeks an answer to the question of the author’s possible inspirational sources.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
